  "description": "Functional refactoring suggestions (light bulb quick fixes) for F#, built on FSharp.Analyzers.SDK. Over 110 rules covering correctness, performance, idiom and redundancy; every one is Hint severity, so they never gate a build.",
  "developmentDependency": true,
